code.build_prompt_function:
function buildPrompt(template, inputs) { return `Using the SOW template structure, generate a complete Statement of Work document for the following project. Fill every section with detailed, specific, professional content.

PROJECT INPUTS:
${JSON.stringify(inputs, null, 2)}

TEMPLATE STRUCTURE:
${JSON.stringify(template.document_structure, null, 2)}

Generate the complete SOW content as a JSON object where each section key contains its generated content. For bullet lists return arrays of strings. For tables return arrays of row arrays. For paragraphs return strings. For code blocks return the code as a string.`; }
